    "title": "SP Classic 6",
    "description": "This Watch Face is customizable, offering 9 font colors, along with 3 customizable complications and cusomizable backgrond, clock hands and index colors. It's designed to provide users with the flexibility to personalize their smartwatch appearance to match their personal taste.\r\n\r\nWatch features:\r\nDate and week\r\n3 customizable Complications\r\n9 font colors\r\n8 background colors\r\n10 Index colors\r\n3 hour/minute hand colors\r\n8 second hand colors\r\n7 small circle colors (comlplication background)\r\n\r\nCustomization:\r\n1 - Tap and hold Display\r\n2 - Tap customize option\r\n3 - Swipe left and right\r\n4 - Swipe up or down\r\n\r\nThis watch face supports all Wear OS devices with API Level 30+ like , Pixel Watch, Fossil, Samsung Galaxy Watch 4, 5, 6, 7, Tag Heuer Connected etc.\r\n\r\nFeel free to leave feedback in the Play Store!",
    "descriptionHTML": "This Watch Face is customizable, offering 9 font colors, along with 3 customizable complications and cusomizable backgrond, clock hands and index colors. It&#39;s designed to provide users with the flexibility to personalize their smartwatch appearance to match their personal taste.<br><br>Watch features:<br>Date and week<br>3 customizable Complications<br>9 font colors<br>8 background colors<br>10 Index colors<br>3 hour/minute hand colors<br>8 second hand colors<br>7 small circle colors (comlplication background)<br><br>Customization:<br>1 - Tap and hold Display<br>2 - Tap customize option<br>3 - Swipe left and right<br>4 - Swipe up or down<br><br>This watch face supports all Wear OS devices with API Level 30+ like , Pixel Watch, Fossil, Samsung Galaxy Watch 4, 5, 6, 7, Tag Heuer Connected etc.<br><br>Feel free to leave feedback in the Play Store!",
